OL,3,GNEWSAChurch's mental health centre
OL,4,Aconversion rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to convert an old church into a
OL,7,Fmental health therapy centre have been
OL,8,Frejected by planners.
OL,10,FThe proposal for the Thanksgiving
OL,11,FShrine of Our Lady of Lourdes on
OL,12,FWhinney Heys Road in Blackpool had been
OL,13,Frecommended for refusal by Blackpool
OL,14,FCouncil's planning officer on several
OL,15,Fgrounds.
OL,17,FPlanning committee councillors agreed
OL,18,Fwith the concerns, which included there
OL,19,Fnot being a proven need for it and the
OL,20,Fdesigns being harmful to the Grade
OL,21,FII*-listed building.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
